    "updated_at": "2026-09-08T15:30:37Z",
    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #340\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed branch `bb/relay-135-heartbeat-agent-tools-02-04-list-proje-thr_6zr8ivzayu` to origin.\n\n## Summary\n\nRegisters `heartbeat.list` and `heartbeat.history` as ungated `AgentTool`s on the schemaCore module manifest:\n\n- **`heartbeat.list`** — returns a project's full heartbeat configuration (rule, assignment/purpose, enabled state, `last_fired_at`). Project scope is derived exclusively from the calling run's persisted `agent_run.project_item_id`, never from a tool argument.\n- **`heartbeat.history`** — returns the last N (default 10, max 100) `agent_runs` records (status, timestamps, result) for one owned heartbeat. Unknown and cross-project `heartbeatId`s produce an identical not-found error via a single scoped `WHERE` clause, avoiding any information leak about heartbeat existence across projects.\n\n`agent_runs.heartbeat_id` already existed and was already populated for both scheduled and `onItemEvent`-triggered runs, so no migration was needed.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `pnpm run test:unit` — 9 files, 83 tests passed (includes new `heartbeatAgentTools.test.ts`)\n- `pnpm run test:integration` — 41 files, 462 tests passed\n- `pnpm run test:e2e` — 1 file, 5 tests passed\n- `pnpm run check:boundaries` — no dependency violations\n- `pnpm -r run build` — full workspace build succeeds\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
