    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #340\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nBranch `bb/relay-135-heartbeat-agent-tools-02-04-list-proje-thr_6zr8ivzayu` is up to date on origin at commit `e3d82a1`.\n\n## Summary\n\nRegisters `heartbeat.list` and `heartbeat.history` as ungated `AgentTool`s on the schemaCore module manifest:\n\n- **`heartbeat.list`** — returns a project's full heartbeat configuration (rule, assignment/purpose, enabled state, `last_fired_at`). Project scope comes exclusively from the calling run's persisted `agent_run.project_item_id`, never from a tool argument.\n- **`heartbeat.history`** — returns the last N (default 10, max 100) `agent_runs` records (status, timestamps, result) for one owned heartbeat. Unknown and cross-project `heartbeatId`s produce an identical not-found error via a single scoped `WHERE` clause.\n\n`agent_runs.heartbeat_id` already existed and was already populated for both scheduled and `onItemEvent`-triggered runs, so no migration was needed. Also merged `develop` in to resolve a conflict in `agentRunsStore.ts` between this branch's `limit` parameter addition and develop's new `getAgentRunsByIds` batch helper — both changes are preserved.\n\n## Verification (against current HEAD `e3d82a1`)\n\n- `pnpm -r run build` — all 11 workspace packages/services build cleanly\n- `pnpm run test:unit` — 10 files, 90 tests passed\n- `pnpm run test:integration` — 63 files, 663 tests passed\n- `pnpm run test:e2e` — 1 file, 5 tests passed\n- `pnpm run check:boundaries` — no dependency violations\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
